            <ArticleTitle>[Results of a multicentre clinical trial studying efficacy and safety of Vasocet in patients with varicose disease and chronic venous insufficiency].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>8-13</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Presented in the article are the findings of a multicenter prospective clinical trial assessing quality of life of patients with chronic diseases of lower limb veins on the background of administration of nonmicronized diosmin (Vasocet). Specialized questionnaires (CIVIQ-2) appeared to be the most optimal evaluating tools, more precisely catching alterations in patients' quality of life on the background of drug therapy.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
